1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,597
November 14, 2026.

2
00:00:01,637 --> 00:00:06,960
A question from Mars to the flight surgeon
takes 22 minutes to go and come back.

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,502
EMMA watches over crew
health on board, offline.

4
00:00:10,542 --> 00:00:13,481
It compares every reading
with that same person

5
00:00:13,521 --> 00:00:16,960
and explains each alert with
its data and its evidence.

6
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:19,204
The crew decides,

7
00:00:19,244 --> 00:00:22,182
and every data point
is signed into a record

8
00:00:22,222 --> 00:00:24,960
that can't be altered without it showing.

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:29,960
EMMA. Decision support
when Earth is far away.
